# Build context for the root Dockerfile. Allowlist: everything is excluded unless re-included below, so local
# secrets, databases, recordings, KEK files and VCS metadata can never leak into an image layer or the build cache.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!api/
!web/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Frontend: dependencies and build output are produced inside the build, never copied from the host.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/blob-report/

# Defense in depth for anything that slipped into an allowlisted directory.
**/*.kek
**/kek
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.hprec
**/*.hprec.partial
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/.DS_Store
